sam: |`md
  # Fleet — SAM positions

  Each role is a single position on three axes: **substance · anchor · modality**.

  | role | actor | substance | anchor | modality |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | scheduler | planner | new | material | prose |
  | launcher | planner | carried | decided | tool |
  | coach | planner | carried | sc | prose |
  | interlocutor | handler | carried | sc | prose |
  | squad-selector | handler | new | material | prose |
  | scribe | handler | carried | decided | tool |
  | executor | handler | carried | material | prose |
  | router | handler | carried | decided | tool |
  | (whole actor) | curator | carried | decided | tool |

  **Substance** — new (brings its own) vs carried (holds what exists).
  **Anchor** — sc (the SC's head) / material (codebase or fleet state) / decided (already settled).
  **Modality** — prose (the conversation) vs tool (a file or artefact).

  Operators are left off for now — these are the roles the SC works with directly.
`|
